  "releaseNotes": "## v2.1.1\n\n            ### Fixed\n            - Ensure / EnsureAsync no longer replace an already-failed result with the validation error.\n              An upstream failure is now returned unchanged (original error preserved, predicate not evaluated).\n              Behavior change: pipelines that relied on Ensure overwriting an earlier failure will now surface\n              the original error. See ReleaseNotes/RELEASE_NOTES_2.1.1.md.\n\n            ## v2.1.0\n            - Changed license from LGPL-3.0-or-later to MPL-2.0\n\n            See MIGRATION_V2.md for v2.0.0 changes.",
